<title>USA: Emcor Group Inc Q1 net profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Emcor Group Inc Q1 net profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>NORWALK, Conn. 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.03     loss	 $0.37</p>
<p> Net profit		   256     loss	 3,653</p>
<p> Revs		     433,770		  382,744</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Q1 1996 loss includes $4.8 million charge from adverse arbitration award in contract dispute.</p>
<p>Operating income for Q1 1997 was $3.4 million, compared to $0.5 million for Q1 1996.</p>
<p>As of March 31, company's backlog was $1.05 billion.</p>
</text>
